# Reviewed 2026-11-19 at the Session 6 gate: published after the green scan of e93e9cf.
# Go stdlib (MaxBytesReader on HTTP/1 servers), fixed in Go 1.26.11 and 1.27.4, found in
# four pinned upstream images: postgres (gosu: opens no socket), restic (a client; `restic
# serve` is not used), openbao (bao, v1.27.3) and traefik (v1.27.3). OpenBao and Traefik do
# serve HTTP/1, Traefik in public: carried to Session 8's security review. Move those pins as
# soon as upstream publishes images built with the fixed Go.
